# Mixdown workspace: track the recipes (source of truth) and project config.
# Everything else is derivable: renders/ is a cache, exports/ are build
# artifacts (the shipped copies live in the mod's assets/), audition/ is a
# generated page, history/ is local version snapshots.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/project.json
!/sounds/

# refs/ are vanilla game sounds copied from the install. Tracked so recipes
# build without a manual re-import step - but they are Anego Studios' assets,
# so drop this exception if this repo ever goes public.
!/refs/
